Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: describe hims,h432b-battery
Upstream-Status: Pending

Describe required device resources separately from board wiring, with
explicit supplies and GPIO roles for validation of the runtime device tree.

---
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/supply/hims,h432b-battery.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,53 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-2-Clause)
+%YAML 1.2
+---
+$id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/power/supply/hims,h432b-battery.yaml#
+$schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
+
+title: H432B split-GPIO battery gauge transport and power indications
+
+maintainers:
+  - Freya Fractal <24643711+highenergymagic@users.noreply.github.com>
+
+description: |
+  The H432B has a single-drop fuel-gauge bus with separate receive and
+  inverted-transmit pins, plus charger and external-source indications.
+  This describes board wiring, not a gauge model or charger-control interface.
+  The timed bus slots require GPIO controllers that do not sleep.
+
+properties:
+  compatible:
+    oneOf:
+      - const: hims,h432b-battery
+      - const: fractal,h432b-battery-inventory
+        deprecated: true
+
+  rx-gpios:
+    maxItems: 1
+    description: Active-high receive level from the single-wire bus.
+
+  pull-low-gpios:
+    maxItems: 1
+    description: Active-high output pulling the single-wire bus low.
+
+  charging-gpios:
+    maxItems: 1
+    description: Active-low charger activity indication.
+
+  secondary-present-gpios:
+    maxItems: 1
+    description: Active-low secondary external-source indication.
+
+  ac-present-gpios:
+    maxItems: 1
+    description: Active-low primary external-source indication.
+
+required:
+  - compatible
+  - rx-gpios
+  - pull-low-gpios
+  - charging-gpios
+  - secondary-present-gpios
+  - ac-present-gpios
+
+additionalProperties: false
